{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/991725303e6ff381cf3b0e3dd87eb686159837a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{2}{3}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/9/d09016ae7d4bb0ccd869b43b3da544e9bacc08e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c85da1d04b4e10c0fe45e42c3bd82e664c003cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9a + 8b}{6a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"39\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2ffaed653e76e000deb9e6142c2a0d7076d19bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   \\frac{7}{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   9 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   \\frac{3}{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   \\frac{11}{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   \\frac{17}{6} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"418\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/991725303e6ff381cf3b0e3dd87eb686159837a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{2}{3}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567ee6519be3a1bb92da6f18836ccf397c9c6ded.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9 \\times \\frac{2}{3}b + 8b}{6 \\times \\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{6b + 8b}{4b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"179\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2598397dd445fbce7f7f966857d92b890e76a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{14b}{4b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f53cb4c11080a1cb3cc62ab7a7a6ce2c3c005da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{7}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"81\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/991725303e6ff381cf3b0e3dd87eb686159837a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{2}{3}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/6/6e6c27bcf6bf7f7544198847fad52d5c40dab45e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{3}{2}a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />. Plugging this in, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2daf42d4d866f0e405286b1e469dde037c7c2a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9a + \\frac{3}{2} \\times 8a}{6a} = \\frac{9a + 12a}{6a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"195\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/4/5745d300793cb2c908a66c61950ab9d238bed2a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{21a}{6a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f53cb4c11080a1cb3cc62ab7a7a6ce2c3c005da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{7}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"81\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat\">2014 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC 